    "updated_at": "2016-11-11T15:38:49Z",
    "body": "To fix the build errors, I think the best thing to do would be to remove the `data-x=\"service-worker-container-interface\"` from line 3888 where the term is introduced, and then remove it from all references, so you can more simply refer to things as just `<code>ServiceWorkerContainer</code>` instead of `<code data-x=\"service-worker-container-interface\">ServiceWorkerContainer</code>`. This might involve rewrapping some lines at the usage sites.\n",
